+"""An explicit assessment target; historical decisions stay unchanged."""
+PROFILE = 'answer-as-written-review-target.v1'
+FIELD = 'answer_review_target_profile'
+GUIDANCE = (
+    'The verdict target is the answer AS WRITTEN, evaluated in relation to the assigned '
+    'source or dependency. It is not a vote on whether the dependency proposal should be '
+    'adopted or whether this individual source independently proves the whole answer. '
+    'A title, date or other metadata may be irrelevant to an operative conclusion; explain '
+    'that relationship. An unnecessary dependency is not itself an answer defect. '
+    'ACCEPT only when delivered evidence establishes that the answer handles this assignment '
+    'correctly, including supported irrelevance or an explicit warranted condition. '
+    'REJECT requires a specific supported defect in the answer: identify its exact claim '
+    'or material omission and explain the contradiction, unsupported inference or lost '
+    'condition. If necessary evidence is missing to judge the answer, use UNRESOLVED and '
+    'identify what is needed. An irrelevant proposal or a source-absence allegation never '
+    'automatically entails ACCEPT. Preserve contrary evidence, necessary client facts, '
+    'material uncertainty and every assignment. Prior verdicts do not determine this review.'
+)
